9. No frontend route protection\
personal-notes-frontend/src/App.jsx:42-49 \'97 All routes are accessible without auth checks. Users see full page shells before the API returns 401.\
Fix: Add a ProtectedRoute wrapper that checks token presence/validity and redirects to /login.\
