11. Sensitive data logged extensively\
server.js:93,126-137, models/User.js:25-26, models/Notes.js:36-37 \'97 Emails, password lengths, decoded JWT payloads, internal MongoDB query structures all logged.\
Fix: Remove all console.log calls or use a structured logger with PII redaction.\
