12. PUT route overwrites fields with undefined\
server.js:260-263 \'97 Sending \{"title": "new"\} omits content, which gets passed as undefined to MongoDB, potentially nullifying the existing value.\
Fix: Build the update object dynamically, only including provided fields.\
